FEAT_TheOpenRoad | The Open Road | passive (core rule) | Arcana_Passive_TheOpenRoad (the mark) + Arcana_Passive_Zephyr, Arcana_Passive_Zephyr_Gale / _Storm / _Hurricane (WB51, WB61) | 1 | — | §4.1, §4.2 | FEAT_Unbound_TheOpenRoad | The wind marks every enemy she touches and carries her to the ones it hasn't touched yet | Any hit of yours or failed save against your effects makes an enemy Windswept until the end of your next turn; a Windswept enemy can't make opportunity attacks; after an unarmed attack or a card, Zephyr Strike as a bonus action
SPL_ZephyrStrike | Zephyr Strike | created card (signature) | Target_Arcana_Created_ZephyrStrike, Rush_Arcana_Created_ZephyrRush, Rush_Arcana_Created_ZephyrRush_Storm, ZEPHYR_STRIKE, ZEPHYR_RUSH, ZEPHYR_RUSH_STORM | 1 (ranks 4 / 8 / 12) | Bonus Action; no slot; the Rush also costs the movement it covers (WB52) | §4.1, §4.2 | FEAT_Unbound_TheOpenRoad | The free wind that carries her | Against an enemy that isn't Windswept it is a Rush to it (9 m at every rank), then an unarmed strike; against a marked one a plain strike; Gale adds a push; Storm: casting the Rush grants one more Rush, within 12 m, to any enemy, for half the movement (WB53)
STA_Windswept | Windswept | status (enemies) | WINDSWEPT | 1 | — | §4.1, §7 | FEAT_Unbound_TheOpenRoad | Shows where the wind has passed | On enemies only; blocks opportunity attacks; the bane's target and the Tempests' target; splits the defences (Wind Whispers and Gale Deflection answer the unmarked, Empty State the marked); cleared by the bag, the sweep, The Calm, the end of her next turn
FEAT_AeolusBag | Aeolus' Bag | feature (ultimate) | Shout_Arcana_Created_AeolusBag (+ one variant per wind and pair), Arcana_Passive_AeolusBag, BAG_READY, BAG_OPEN | 2 | Bonus Action; needs 1 Windswept enemy; usable out of combat (WB58) | §4.3, §4.6 | FEAT_Unbound_AeolusBag | Release what the wind gathered as one wind over the battle | Choose a wind (Boreas, Notus; Eurus from Gale); it blows X turns, X = marks when opened, capped by rank; opening clears the marks; while it blows it sweeps every mark at her turn start; a wind already blowing is never refreshed (WB60); boon for allies, bane on Windswept enemies; two winds at Hurricane
SPL_TheCalm | The Calm | created card (Aspect card) | Shout_Arcana_Created_TheCalm | 3 (Tier I) | Action; free; once per combat; usable out of combat (WB58) | §4.4 | SPL_Unbound_TheCalm | Force 0: the wind dies in one blast | Only while a wind blows; each remaining turn of wind becomes a gust of Thunder on every Windswept enemy; every mark swept; the bag can reopen at once
SPL_UnleashedWinds | Unleashed Winds | feature (capstone) | Target_Arcana_Created_UnleashedWinds | 11 | Action; slot 6; not while the bag is open | §4.5 | SPL_Unbound_UnleashedWinds | The four winds scatter the field by the marks | A point within 18 m, enemies within 9 m make a STR save: 4d8 Thunder, Windswept enemies pulled 6 m to the centre, the others pushed 6 m away, Off Balance 1 turn; half damage on a success (WB56)
